                        # For example, the gds file is not colorized, you could use the common virtuoso format gds layer map to stream gds file.
                        # #layer name #purpose name #stream layer #stream data type
                        # V0 drawing 35 0
                        # V0 drawing 35 235
                        # V0 drawing 35 236
                        # M1 drawing 15 0
                        # M1 drawing 15 235
                        # M1 drawing 15 236
                        # M1 drawing 15 239
                        # For example, the gds file is colorized, you could specify the mask color in gds layer map to stream gds file.
                        # #layer name #purpose name #stream layer #stream data type #photo mask color #color state
                        # V0 drawing 35 0
                        # V0 drawing 35 235 mask1Color unlocked
                        # V0 drawing 35 236 mask2Color unlocked
                        # M1 drawing 15 0
                        # M1 drawing 15 235 mask1Color unlocked
                        # M1 drawing 15 236 mask2Color unlocked
                        # M1 drawing 15 239 mask3Color unlocked
